<section id="guarantees" style="background:var(--paper2);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kick">Guarantees</p>
    <h2>Built so it never makes things <em>worse</em>.</h2>
    <p class="lede">These are product rules, not marketing. If it doesn’t pay off, it turns itself off.</p>
    <div class="guar" data-reveal>
      <div class="g"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/></svg><b>Main session untouched</b><span>Only subagents get routed.</span></div>
      <div class="g"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><b>Never blocks you</b><span>If Horsy fails or is slow, everything runs as before.</span></div>
      <div class="g"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4"/></svg><b>Local and fast</b><span>Routing runs on your machine in tens of milliseconds. Only metadata leaves it.</span></div>
      <div class="g"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21V3M7 16l5 5 5-5"/></svg><b>Down only when cheaper</b><span>Expected cost and time, retries included, must be lower.</span></div>
      <div class="g"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v9"/><path d="M6.3 7.5a8 8 0 1 0 11.4 0"/></svg><b>Turns itself off</b><span>Any task type where it’s losing goes back to your default model.</span></div>
      <div class="g"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h2M10 17h10"/><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2"/><circle cx="8" cy="17" r="2"/></svg><b>You stay in control</b><span><code>/horsy off</code>, pin a model per task, one-line receipts.</span></div>
      <div class="g"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3h12v18l-3-2-3 2-3-2-3 2z"/><path d="M9 8h6M9 12h6"/></svg><b>Honest receipts</b><span>Net time, net cost, errors caught. Even when negative.</span></div>
      <div class="g"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V7z"/></svg><b>Neutral</b><span>A model grading itself has a conflict of interest. Horsy is an independent check, and later routes to other providers and local models.</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="ph" aria-label="Placeholder for future beta stats">
      <p class="note">Placeholder · beta stats go here once they are real</p>
      <div><b>X</b><span>sessions verified</span></div>
      <div><b>Y</b><span>false “done” caught</span></div>
      <div><b>Z</b><span>net saved, all receipts summed</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="bip"><b>Built in public.</b> Every number on this page will come from receipts you can inspect. Follow along on <a href="https://github.com/paoloxia/horsy-landing">GitHub</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
